WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.510
- Welcome back, before we say goodbye

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:04.450
we like to play a quick round of-

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:08.550
- Drewth or dare!
(people cheering)

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.350
- Today we have Logan Johnson.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:13.230
Hi Logan.
- Hi Drew, hi Ross.

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.740
- How are y'all?
- Thank you, I'm good.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.990
I wanted to thank you both
for everything you do.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:20.220
This show is so beautiful and
it's my daily dose of joy.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.233
- Aah.
- Thank you so much.

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:24.273
- Thank you.
(people cheering)

00:00:24.273 --> 00:00:25.900
Thank you so much.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.710
- Is it gonna be a Drewth or a dare?

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.170
- It's going to be a dare.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.980
- Okay.
- Whoa!

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:33.780
- We've never said no
before, so bring it on.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.570
- Okay. You ready?
- Yeah.

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:38.020
- I love sour foods.

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:40.630
I dare you to eat a quarter of a lemon

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:43.050
while keeping a total poker face.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:44.720
- I love this dare!
- Ah.

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:46.330
- Do you have a lemon?

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:48.726
- Someone does.
(people laughing)

00:00:48.726 --> 00:00:49.830
- Oh.
- Oh.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:51.450
- We just found some on the desk.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.313
- Okay. Three, two, go.

00:00:56.857 --> 00:01:01.857
- Ooh.
(people laughing)

00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:05.697
(people laughing)

00:01:05.697 --> 00:01:10.114
- Oh god! I failed!
(people cheering)

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.880
- I now wanna see more people do this

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.320
and see who can and can't,

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:19.790
'cause it was impossible
not to make the pickle face.

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:23.010
- Mm hmm.
- It's a new TikTok challenge.

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:24.480
Try it home, try it at home.
- Hey.

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:26.130
- Let's start one.
- Let's do it.

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:30.370
- Let's do it right now.
- Yes, #lemonface.

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:34.590
- We challenge you to a TikTok challenge.

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:39.370
Can you eat a lemon and
keep a straight face?

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:40.890
I'll tell you, I couldn't do it.

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:42.100
- Mm hmm.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.086
Let's see-
- Can you do it?

00:01:43.086 --> 00:01:44.000
- Let's see if this happens.
(people cheering)

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.533
Thank you so much, Logan.
- Thank you.

00:01:46.533 --> 00:01:47.366
- Thank you.
- And thank you

00:01:47.366 --> 00:01:48.210
for your kind words.
- Thank you.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.630
- Really and truly.
(people cheering)

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:51.440
'Cause that is actually the whole point.

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:52.840
I just wanna thank everyone

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.810
for choosing to spend their time with us,

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:59.290
because, to Logan's point,
we make this show for you.

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:03.164
So take it with you and
thank you so much for coming,

00:02:03.164 --> 00:02:04.216
everybody.
(people cheering)

00:02:04.216 --> 00:02:05.049
Thank you.

00:02:06.156 --> 00:02:08.823
(upbeat music)

